DTSTAMP:20261121T132509Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261124T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261124T210000
SUMMARY:AI Safety: Building Trustworthy AI in the Real World
LOCATION:Zalando\, Prime Tower\, Hardstrasse 201\, Zurich
DESCRIPTION:Four speakers from Google\, AWS\, Unique and Systematic-X on ke
 eping AI systems trustworthy once they act on their own — how to evaluat
 e and monitor before and after deployment\, where guardrails\, human overs
 ight and red-teaming fit\, and how to ship fast without losing accountabil
 ity.\n\nOrganiser: Elevate Tech: Women and Minorities in AI\, Tech\, and S
 cience\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/ai-s
 afety-trustworthy-ai-zurich-2026/
